subckt opamp_differential (VIP VIN VOP VON VDD VSS)
parameters gain=1e6
EPLUS (VOP 0 VIP VIN) vcvs gain=gain/2
EMINUS (VON 0 VIN VIP) vcvs gain=gain/2
ends opamp_differential

subckt dut (VSS Vinp Vinn Voutn Voutp VREF CLK1 CLK2 S4 S6)
subckt ideal_switch (p n cp cn)
parameters ron=1 roff=1e12 vt=0.5
core (p n) bsource i=v(p,n)/(v(cp,cn)>vt ? ron : roff)
ends ideal_switch
C_I (Voutp net2) capacitor c=1p
C2 (net4 net5) capacitor c=1p
CI (Voutn net1) capacitor c=1p
CS (net3 net0) capacitor c=1p
S1 (Vinp net0 CLK1 VSS) ideal_switch
S10 (Vinp net0 CLK1 VSS) ideal_switch
S2 (net0 VREF CLK2 VSS) ideal_switch
S3 (Vinn net5 CLK1 VSS) ideal_switch
S4 (net0 VREF S4 VSS) ideal_switch
S5 (VREF net4 CLK1 VSS) ideal_switch
S6 (VREF net5 S6 VSS) ideal_switch
S7 (net4 net2 CLK2 VSS) ideal_switch
S8 (net3 net1 CLK2 VSS) ideal_switch
S9 (net3 VREF CLK1 VSS) ideal_switch
X1 (net2 net1 Voutp Voutn 0 0) opamp_differential gain=1e6
